;
; Test-only observer: records the levels present on a pin pair, one sample per PIO
; cycle. IN base is the low pin of the pair, so a sample is the {TXP,TXN} level code
; itself; sixteen samples fill a 32-bit word and are autopushed for DMA. Run at the
; same /1 clock as the state machine under observation and started in lockstep with
; it, one sample is one 120 MHz cycle, so run lengths in the capture are cycle counts.

.program pin_capture

.wrap_target
    in pins, 2
.wrap
